{"seq":2,"slug":"brownian-motion-statistical","title":"布朗运动与统计物理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/quantum-and-statistical/brownian-motion-statistical","wordCount":1407,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"布朗运动与统计物理\">布朗运动与统计物理</h1><p>1905 年 5 月 11 日，《物理年鉴》收到爱因斯坦奇迹年的第三篇论文：《关于热的分子运动论所要求的静止液体中悬浮小颗粒的运动》。它讨论的是显微镜下花粉颗粒那永不停歇的随机抖动，却为一个延续半个多世纪的哲学之争——原子是否真实存在——画上了句号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>布朗运动是悬浮在液体中的微小颗粒不停做无规则运动的现象。爱因斯坦用统计物理把这种宏观可见的抖动，定量地联系到看不见的分子热运动上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[液体中无数分子做热运动] --&gt; B[分子从各方向随机撞击悬浮颗粒]&#10;    B --&gt; C[瞬时合力随机涨落]&#10;    C --&gt; D[颗粒做无规则随机游走]&#10;    D --&gt; E[位移均方与时间成正比]&#10;    E --&gt; F[可测量阿伏伽德罗常数]\">flowchart TD\n    A[液体中无数分子做热运动] --&gt; B[分子从各方向随机撞击悬浮颗粒]\n    B --&gt; C[瞬时合力随机涨落]\n    C --&gt; D[颗粒做无规则随机游走]\n    D --&gt; E[位移均方与时间成正比]\n    E --&gt; F[可测量阿伏伽德罗常数]</pre><p>布朗运动把宏观现象与微观分子图景连接起来，其意义可对照如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层面</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现象层</td>\n<td>显微镜下颗粒持续随机抖动，方向无规律</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微观机制</td>\n<td>数以亿计的分子从各方向不平衡地撞击颗粒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数学描述</td>\n<td>颗粒位移服从随机游走，均方位移正比于时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可检验预言</td>\n<td>由位移统计可算出阿伏伽德罗常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>科学意义</td>\n<td>为原子和分子的真实存在提供定量证据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"现象的发现与未解之谜\">现象的发现与未解之谜</h2><p>1827 年，英国植物学家布朗（Robert Brown）在显微镜下观察悬浮在水中的花粉颗粒，发现它们不停地做杂乱无章的抖动。他起初以为这是花粉&quot;有生命&quot;的表现，但换上无机粉末后抖动依旧，说明它与生命无关。</p>\n<p>此后近八十年，这种运动一直没有令人信服的解释。它看似永不停息，仿佛违背能量守恒；颗粒越小、温度越高，抖动越剧烈。人们隐约觉得它与分子有关，却无法给出定量的、可检验的理论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"爱因斯坦的统计推理\">爱因斯坦的统计推理</h2><p>爱因斯坦的关键洞见是：不要去追踪每一次分子撞击，而是用统计的方法描述颗粒的累积位移。</p>\n<p>悬浮颗粒被周围数以亿计的分子从各个方向撞击。在任一瞬间，来自各方向的撞击不会完全抵消，留下一个随机的净作用力，推动颗粒走一小步；下一刻方向又变。无数小步累积起来，就是我们看到的随机游走。</p>\n<p>他推导出，颗粒在一维方向上的均方位移与观测时间成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle x^2 \\rangle = 2 D t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是时间。更进一步，他给出了扩散系数与微观量的关系（爱因斯坦关系）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\frac{k_B T}{6 \\pi \\eta r} = \\frac{R T}{6 \\pi \\eta r N_A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是玻尔兹曼常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是液体黏度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是颗粒半径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是气体常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是阿伏伽德罗常数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条可检验的桥梁\">一条可检验的桥梁</h2><p>这组公式的精妙之处在于：等式右边的量——温度、黏度、颗粒半径——都可以测量，而左边的均方位移可以在显微镜下统计得到。把它们代入，就能反推出阿伏伽德罗常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即一摩尔物质所含的分子数目。</p>\n<p>换句话说，爱因斯坦把一个肉眼可见的现象（颗粒抖动多远）变成了一把&quot;称量分子&quot;的尺子。这是布朗运动论文最革命的地方：它不是泛泛地说&quot;分子在撞击颗粒&quot;，而是给出了一个能用实验定量验证的精确预言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"佩兰的实验与原子论的胜利\">佩兰的实验与原子论的胜利</h2><p>1908 年至 1909 年，法国物理学家佩兰（Jean Perrin）做了一系列精细的显微镜实验，系统地测量了悬浮颗粒的位移分布，并据此算出阿伏伽德罗常数。他得到的数值与从其他完全独立的方法（如气体理论、黑体辐射）得到的结果高度一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实验者</td>\n<td>让·佩兰（Jean Perrin）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>1908–1909</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方法</td>\n<td>测量悬浮颗粒的均方位移与沉降分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与独立方法吻合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影响</td>\n<td>实证原子真实存在，佩兰获 1926 年诺贝尔奖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多个独立途径给出同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，这种一致性极具说服力。它终结了以马赫（Ernst Mach）和奥斯特瓦尔德（Wilhelm Ostwald）为代表的&quot;反原子论&quot;立场——他们曾坚持原子只是方便的数学虚构。佩兰本人因此项工作于 1926 年获得诺贝尔物理学奖，奥斯特瓦尔德也公开承认原子论已被实验证实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>布朗运动论文发表于 1905 年 5 月，解释了悬浮颗粒为何不停随机抖动。</li>\n<li>爱因斯坦用统计方法把颗粒位移与分子热运动定量联系，得出均方位移正比于时间。</li>\n<li>爱因斯坦关系把可测的扩散系数与阿伏伽德罗常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 联系起来，提供可检验预言。</li>\n<li>佩兰于 1908–1909 年的实验证实了该理论，并算出与独立方法一致的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>这项工作为原子和分子的真实存在提供了决定性证据，终结了反原子论之争。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"photoelectric-effect\">光电效应</a>：同年 3 月的姊妹篇——奇迹年从这篇&quot;最革命&quot;的量子论文开始。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../physics-revolutions/special-relativity\">狭义相对论</a>：同年 6 月投出的第三篇；四篇奇迹年论文中的两篇都靠同一种统计式思维取胜。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"布朗运动与统计物理","id":"布朗运动与统计物理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"现象的发现与未解之谜","id":"现象的发现与未解之谜"},{"level":2,"text":"爱因斯坦的统计推理","id":"爱因斯坦的统计推理"},{"level":2,"text":"一条可检验的桥梁","id":"一条可检验的桥梁"},{"level":2,"text":"佩兰的实验与原子论的胜利","id":"佩兰的实验与原子论的胜利"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"光电效应","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect"},"next":{"title":"诺贝尔奖与荣誉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/legacy-and-recognition/nobel-prize-and-honors"}}